WEBVTT

00:04:58.510 --> 00:05:01.310
The difference between humans and Neanderthal

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:04.609
is 0.004 percent of gene code.

00:05:04.609 --> 00:05:06.309
That's how big the difference is

00:05:06.309 --> 00:05:08.526
one species to another.

00:05:08.526 --> 00:05:12.926
This explains most contemporary political debates.

00:05:12.926 --> 00:05:14.861
(Laughter)

00:05:14.861 --> 00:05:18.072
But as you're thinking about this,

00:05:18.072 --> 00:05:19.430
one of the interesting things

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:22.827
is how small these mutations are and where they take place.

00:05:22.827 --> 00:05:24.160
Difference human/Neanderthal

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:25.893
is sperm and testis,

00:05:25.893 --> 00:05:27.261
smell and skin.

00:05:27.261 --> 00:05:28.747
And those are the specific genes

00:05:28.747 --> 00:05:31.427
that differ from one to the other.